	(descr "GoldenMorning 0.71in round TFT display, GC9D01 driver, 160x160, 4-wire SPI. Board 21 x 27.3 x 5.6mm. Mounts on a 1x8 2.54mm pin header above the PCB - the display body overhangs, so the courtyard only covers the header + 2 mounting holes, leaving the area under the display free for other parts. Mounting holes M2 est. Pins 1-8: GND VDD SCL SDA RES DC CS BL")
